Package: tlumacz
Version: 0.20.1-2
Architecture: all
Maintainer: frs <frs@users.noreply.github.com>
Depends: python3, python3-pyside6, python3-openai, python3-pymupdf, hicolor-icon-theme
Description: AI-powered document translator with a Qt GUI
 Tłumacz is a Qt/PySide6 application for translating documents using
 LLM models compatible with the OpenAI API.
